  "contentHtml": "<p>상염색체 유전 형질 정리 하면서 맘마미아에서 소피가 아빠를 찾는다는 설정으로 진행해 보았습니다.</p><p>가볍게 수업하기 좋을 것 같아 올려봅니다.</p><p>1. ppt로 부모와 자식이 서로 닮음을 설명</p><p>2. 동영상으로 맘마미아 영화 내용 소개</p><p>3. 활동지</p><p>4. 영화의 한 장면(저는 slipping&#160;through&#160;my&#160;fingers 보여줬어요^^)&#160;보여주며 소피의 얼굴 확인</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bf91607313912f62e68e4504ab4749bf71883053?download\" data-file-name=\"유전형질-소피의 아빠 찾기.pptx\" data-file-size=\"1959012\" data-mimetype=\"application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.presentationml.presentation\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D640%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20201104142159&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fbf91607313912f62e68e4504ab4749bf71883053')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">유전형질-소피의 아빠 찾기</span><span class=\"type\">.pptx</span></div><div class=\"size\">1.87MB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e8424891c0324da24621fbf6de83a4fde8e826a5?download\" data-file-name=\"상염색체 유전-맘마미아.pdf\" data-file-size=\"103338\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D640%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20201104142159&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fe8424891c0324da24621fbf6de83a4fde8e826a5')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">상염색체 유전-맘마미아</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">100.92KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv5ns4l0esy95c5uxfdt6bhj6@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-